# VICE.DEV — The Developer Experience

An open-world, neon-soaked **developer portfolio template** built with Next.js. Visitors don't scroll a list of cards: they enter a city, explore a map, take on missions, check their phone and tune the radio. Recruiters still get a fast, accessible site with a **Skip intro** button and normal navigation.

> Fan-inspired by the sunset/neon aesthetic of modern open-world crime games. **Not affiliated with or endorsed by any game studio.** No game assets, logos, fonts or music are used. Everything visual is drawn in SVG/CSS, and the radio is synthesized live in the browser.

