## Features

| | Feature | What it does |
|---|---|---|
| 🎬 | **Loading screen** | Poster-style intro with tips and a progress bar. Shown once per session. Always skippable. |
| 🌆 | **Cinematic hero** | Procedural skyline, synthwave sun, swaying palms, parallax, and a game-style HUD (level, XP, cash, wanted stars). |
| 🗺️ | **Interactive city map** | SVG map with GPS routes. Each district is a section: Downtown (about), Tech District (skills), Business Bay (projects), University (experience), Beach Club (interests), Safehouse (contact). |
| 📁 | **Mission-based projects** | Projects shown as missions with difficulty, status, tech stack, XP reward, links and a full Markdown case study page. |
| 🧑‍🎤 | **Character profile** | Bio, self-assessed stat bars, languages and personal achievements. |
| 🌳 | **Skill tree** | RPG-style branches (frontend / backend / devops / design) with unlock animations. |
| 📱 | **In-game smartphone** | Contacts, Gallery, Social, Browser (blog), Email (contact form), Music, Trophies, Map, Terminal and Settings apps. |
| 📻 | **Radio stations** | Three procedurally generated stations (Web Audio API, no audio files). Add your own MP3s too. |
| 💻 | **Developer terminal** | Press `` ` `` for a working command line: `help`, `projects`, `open 1`, `goto contact`, `weather rain`… |
| 🏆 | **Achievements** | 13 unlockable trophies, saved in the visitor's browser. |
| 🌙 | **Day / sunset / night** | Re-tints the entire city. |
| 🌧️ | **Weather** | Rain (canvas) and fog overlays. |
| ⭐ | **Wanted system & easter eggs** | Wanted stars, the Konami code, a hidden location… |
| 📰 | **City news blog** | Markdown posts styled like breaking news. |
| 🤝 | **Hire system** | Mission-type picker, validated contact form, email delivery, resume download, booking link and availability indicator. Honeypot, timing check and rate limiting stop spam. |
| 🛠️ | **Admin dashboard** | Password-protected `/admin` to manage missions, skills, posts and your contact inbox (requires a database). |
| ♿ | **Accessible by default** | Skip link, keyboard-operable map and phone, `prefers-reduced-motion` support, no-JS fallback, semantic HTML. |
| 🔎 | **SEO** | Per-page titles, descriptions and canonical URLs, JSON-LD structured data (Person, WebSite, projects, posts, breadcrumbs), sitemap, robots, RSS feed and web manifest. Preview deployments are never indexed. |
| 🖼️ | **Social previews** | Generated 1200×630 link-preview cards for the site, every mission and every blog post: X, LinkedIn, Slack, Discord, WhatsApp. |

## Quick start

**Prerequisites:** Node.js 18.18 or newer (20+ recommended) and npm.

```bash
git clone https://github.com/abdullahkalim21/gta6-portfolio.git
cd gta6-portfolio
npm install
npm run dev
```

Open http://localhost:3000. **No environment variables are needed to run the site.** Without a database, all content comes from the files in `src/content/` and `src/config/`.

## Make it yours (5 minutes)

1. **`src/config/site.ts`**: your name, role, bio, stats, experience, socials, interests, HUD values, radio stations and SEO.
2. **`src/content/projects.ts`**: your projects (missions). Case studies are Markdown.
3. **`src/content/skills.ts`**: your skill tree.
4. **`src/content/posts.ts`**: blog posts (optional; delete them all to hide the news section).
5. **`public/resume.pdf`**: replace it with your real resume.
6. Optional: add `public/images/avatar.jpg` and set `player.avatar`, and add project screenshots.

The full guide is in **[docs/CUSTOMIZATION.md](docs/CUSTOMIZATION.md)**.

## Optional: database, admin and email

| You want… | Set these env vars | Guide |
|---|---|---|
| Admin dashboard + contact inbox | `DATABASE_URL`, `ADMIN_PASSWORD`, `AUTH_SECRET` | [docs/DATABASE.md](docs/DATABASE.md) |
| Contact form emails | `RESEND_API_KEY`, `CONTACT_TO_EMAIL`, `CONTACT_FROM_EMAIL` | [docs/DEPLOYMENT.md](docs/DEPLOYMENT.md#email-resend) |
| "Book a call" button | `NEXT_PUBLIC_CALENDLY_URL` | — |
| Correct canonical URLs, social previews and sitemap | `NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL` | [docs/SEO.md](docs/SEO.md) |
| Google / Bing Search Console verification | `GOOGLE_SITE_VERIFICATION`, `BING_SITE_VERIFICATION` | [docs/SEO.md](docs/SEO.md) |

Copy `.env.example` to `.env` and fill in only what you need.

## Scripts

| Command | What it does |
|---|---|
| `npm run dev` | Start the dev server on :3000 |
| `npm run build` | Generate the Prisma client and build for production |
| `npm start` | Run the production build |
| `npm run typecheck` | TypeScript check |
| `npm run db:push` | Create/update database tables from `prisma/schema.prisma` |
| `npm run db:seed` | Copy `src/content/*` into the database |
| `npm run db:setup` | `db:push` + `db:seed` |
| `npm run db:studio` | Open Prisma Studio |
| `npm run media:screenshots` | Re-capture the README screenshots (site must be running) |
| `npm run media:video` / `media:encode` | Re-record the walkthrough and encode the MP4 + GIFs (needs ffmpeg) |

## Tech stack

- **Next.js 15** (App Router, React 19, Server Components, ISR)
- **TypeScript** and **Tailwind CSS v4**
- **Framer Motion** for animation
- **Prisma** + **PostgreSQL** (optional; Supabase, Neon, Railway, Vercel Postgres or local Docker)
- **Zod** for validation
- **Resend** HTTP API for email (no SDK needed)
- **Vercel Analytics** (enabled automatically on Vercel)

## Project structure

```text
src/
├── app/
│   ├── (site)/              # Public site (shares the game shell: navbar, phone, terminal, radio)
│   │   ├── page.tsx         # Homepage: intro → hero → map → sections
│   │   ├── projects/        # /projects and /projects/[slug]
│   │   ├── blog/            # /blog and /blog/[slug]
│   │   └── hideout/         # 🤫
│   ├── admin/               # /admin dashboard + /admin/login
│   ├── api/
│   │   ├── contact/         # Contact form endpoint
│   │   └── admin/           # Auth + CRUD endpoints
│   ├── opengraph-image.tsx  # Generated social preview
│   ├── sitemap.ts / robots.ts
│   └── globals.css          # Design tokens, time-of-day palettes
├── components/
│   ├── hero/  city-map/  missions/  skill-tree/  sections/  contact/
│   ├── phone/  terminal/  hud/  intro/  effects/  easter-eggs/  admin/
│   └── providers/           # GameProvider (state, achievements) + RadioProvider
├── config/
│   ├── site.ts              # ← edit me
│   └── achievements.ts
├── content/                 # ← edit me: projects, skills, posts
└── lib/                     # data layer, db, auth, validation, radio engine
prisma/
├── schema.prisma
└── seed.ts
```

